/* Psykolog.no webfonts.
   No binaries were supplied with the brand guidelines, so the three families
   are loaded from Google Fonts, which hosts all of them at the required weights.
   Inria Serif  — display & headings (700, 700 italic)
   Inria Sans   — body & long form   (400, 400 italic, 700)
   Inter        — interface          (500, 700)
   Replace with self-hosted @font-face rules when licensed binaries arrive. */
